      `the claimant shows that there was good cause for the delay throughout the period that begins on the day on which the deadline expired and that ends on the day on which the claimant informs the Commission of their election` IS A BOOLEAN  -- out of range: a judgment the text leaves to the Commission (and on appeal the Tribunal); never worked out here
